10.79,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1002/anie.202405679","Year":2024,"Counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-041756","value":"15.28 ± 0.31","numeric":15.28}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-041757","Abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru1","Cell_line":"CMT-167","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":"10.76 ± 0.24","IC50_Dark_value":10.76,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1002/anie.202405679","Year":2024,"Counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-041757","value":"11.75 ± 0.58","numeric":11.75}}],"logp":[{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru1","value":0.63,"value_relation":"=","std":0.02,"type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","doi":"10.1002/anie.202405679","year":2024,"counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","record_id":"MLDB-004565","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"The lipophilicities of the complexes were determined according to the previously reported method. Octanol-saturated water (OSW) and water-saturated octanol (WSO) were prepared by mixing octanol and water. Aliquots of stock solutions of the ruthenium complexes in OSW were added to equal volumes of WSO and shaken at 100 rpm. After 24 h, the sample was centrifuged at 3000 rpm for 10 min. The aqueous and octanol layers were carefully separated into test tubes and analyzed by UV-Vis spectroscopy. Partition coefficients of ruthenium complexes were calculated using the equation:log Po/w = log ([Ru]OSW / [Ru]WSO)"}]}